WEBVTT

00:04.640 --> 00:06.420
<b>I've got proof now!</b>

00:06.420 --> 00:10.310
<b>Star's bad at increasing her own power.</b>

00:11.890 --> 00:16.530
<b>New Order seems like it's a Quirk 
that can do anything at first,</b>

00:16.530 --> 00:19.380
<b>but there's a limit to the 
amount of power it can add.</b>

00:19.700 --> 00:22.960
<b>It doesn't work no matter 
how I make the rule.</b>

00:22.960 --> 00:25.860
<b>The people who know me well say,</b>

00:25.860 --> 00:29.960
<b>"Quirks work on a mental level, you know"</b>

00:29.960 --> 00:33.000
<b>and "It's because you're a girl, Cassie."</b>

00:33.950 --> 00:35.970
<b>Because you're a girl?</b>

00:35.970 --> 00:38.370
<b>That has nothing to do with it, Star.</b>

00:39.060 --> 00:41.570
<b>That's just the kind of Quirk it is.</b>

00:41.570 --> 00:44.680
<b>If it's not enough, then make 
up for it with us soldiers.</b>

00:45.070 --> 00:47.140
<b>That's what it means to be human.</b>

00:47.140 --> 00:50.120
<b>Well, you're plenty strong 
right now, though.</b>

00:50.500 --> 00:53.330
<b>It's just that you're comparing 
yourself to All Might.</b>

00:53.330 --> 00:57.570
<b>She's the only one who can seriously 
think of getting to his level, though.</b>

00:57.570 --> 00:59.340
<b>Yeah, since they're both gorillas.</b>

00:59.340 --> 01:00.720
<b>Hey!</b>

01:04.150 --> 01:05.250
<b>Star!</b>

01:07.290 --> 01:09.940
<b>Basically, don't get too 
worked up about it.</b>

01:13.610 --> 01:14.970
<b>Not even once...</b>

01:15.920 --> 01:19.060
<b>...did they say the words I hated.</b>

02:52.440 --> 02:54.510
<b>Star! Tiamat is coming!</b>

02:55.150 --> 02:57.480
<b>Those hypersonic missiles...</b>

02:57.810 --> 02:59.080
<b>Can you touch them?</b>

02:59.080 --> 03:03.560
<b>Yeah! But I'll have to release the laser.</b>

03:03.560 --> 03:05.990
<b>Fill in the gaps with concentrated fire!</b>

03:06.380 --> 03:09.240
<b>If I lose focus, the attacks 
will start right away!</b>

03:10.630 --> 03:14.420
<b>She should know that this 
attack doesn't work on me.</b>

03:15.340 --> 03:20.560
<b>This bundle of lasers is just able to hold 
me down and keep me from regenerating.</b>

03:21.980 --> 03:24.230
<b>In other words,</b>

03:24.230 --> 03:29.920
<b>Ms. Star understands that she needs a single 
attack that can pulverize me or there's no point.</b>

03:30.310 --> 03:32.440
<b>She's waiting for something.</b>

03:32.870 --> 03:35.680
<b>For something even stronger 
than what she's had so far.</b>

03:36.790 --> 03:37.930
<b>Don't tell me...</b>

03:38.360 --> 03:40.070
<b>Okay, Star!</b>

03:40.070 --> 03:42.570
<b>You want us to keep staving 
off his regeneration</b>

03:42.570 --> 03:46.110
<b>so you can hit him with a 
super strong blast, right?</b>

03:46.440 --> 03:47.650
<b>It can't be...</b>

03:47.650 --> 03:49.330
<b>No, but she must...</b>

03:49.720 --> 03:53.360
<b>That means this is a watershed 
moment for both of us...</b>

03:53.830 --> 03:56.320
<b>Jeez, this is like...</b>

03:56.320 --> 03:59.080
<b>...forcing each other to play shitty games!</b>

03:59.730 --> 04:00.930
<b>Counting down!</b>

04:00.930 --> 04:02.120
<b>Three!</b>

04:02.510 --> 04:03.530
<b>Two!</b>

04:03.750 --> 04:04.710
<b>One!</b>

04:11.070 --> 04:13.750
<b>Before my arm gets blown away at the elbow--</b>

04:14.190 --> 04:15.600
<b>New Order!</b>

04:15.940 --> 04:19.590
<b>"Tiamat will be redirected"!</b>

04:20.810 --> 04:23.940
<b>If the rule is imposed 
on just one missile...</b>

04:25.330 --> 04:26.630
<b>Fire!</b>

04:28.620 --> 04:35.250
<b>State-of-the-Art Hypersonic 
Intercontinental Cruise Punch!</b>

04:40.080 --> 04:41.280
<b>Did it work?</b>

04:47.420 --> 04:48.640
<b>That's...</b>

04:53.010 --> 04:54.210
<b>Did I get him?</b>

05:00.940 --> 05:04.870
<b>I can control my Decay.</b>

05:06.070 --> 05:08.740
<b>I knew you had something up your sleeve.</b>

05:09.690 --> 05:12.610
<b>And based on our fight so far,</b>

05:12.610 --> 05:16.240
<b>I was pretty sure New Order could 
only be used on two things at once.</b>

05:16.240 --> 05:20.330
<b>So if you were planning something, 
the situation would change.</b>

05:20.770 --> 05:21.870
<b>In that case--</b>

05:22.560 --> 05:27.180
<b>The instant the rule changed, I would 
use Decay to bury deep underground</b>

05:27.180 --> 05:29.040
<b>and let that "something" go by!</b>

05:29.400 --> 05:32.770
<b>If I buried myself before the rule changed, 
you'd figure it out and counter.</b>

05:32.770 --> 05:35.820
<b>It was really close! A gamble!</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:39.660
<b>If I hadn't used a Nomu as a decoy...</b>

05:40.530 --> 05:42.430
<b>If I'd been just a second too late...</b>

05:42.430 --> 05:44.350
<b>It would've been fatal.</b>

05:45.280 --> 05:47.770
<b>That bastard used a Nomu as a decoy!</b>

05:47.770 --> 05:49.250
<b>You knew, didn't you?</b>

05:49.580 --> 05:52.150
<b>That we'd both be coming with shitty games!</b>

05:52.890 --> 05:54.550
<b>If you hadn't been up against me,</b>

05:54.550 --> 05:56.710
<b>you would've been able to die 
without using the excuse</b>

05:56.710 --> 05:58.950
<b>that you weren't strong enough!</b>

05:59.330 --> 06:00.920
<b>All aircraft, support Star!</b>

06:00.920 --> 06:02.090
<b>Get back to formation!</b>

06:02.380 --> 06:03.840
<b>Make a place for Star to stand!</b>

06:03.840 --> 06:05.540
<b>I won't let you!</b>

06:06.080 --> 06:07.290
<b>Release that power!</b>

06:15.430 --> 06:18.220
<b>Give me that Quirk!</b>

06:19.180 --> 06:23.270
<b>I'll use it better than you!</b>

06:26.610 --> 06:27.730
<b>Do it, Star!</b>

06:28.330 --> 06:30.630
<b>Don't worry about getting 
me if you can crush Tomura!</b>

06:30.630 --> 06:34.590
<b>You can turn him to dust with 
the explosion from the plane!</b>

06:35.430 --> 06:38.750
<b>No, he'll be able to regenerate in time!</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:39.500
<b>Star!</b>

06:53.100 --> 06:57.100
<b>Specter</b>

06:58.800 --> 07:01.680
<b>In the first place, what 
I really didn't want...</b>

07:02.600 --> 07:06.960
<b>was New Order colluding with One For All.</b>

07:07.910 --> 07:11.830
<b>After we shut down the Heroes 
Public Safety Commission,</b>

07:12.390 --> 07:16.670
<b>the sabotage by my friends overseas</b>

07:16.670 --> 07:22.120
<b>slowed down the dispatch of heroes 
from around the world to Japan.</b>

07:24.230 --> 07:26.520
<b>It was all to complete my body,</b>

07:26.520 --> 07:30.230
<b>steal One For All, and then...</b>

07:30.230 --> 07:33.490
<b>take on New Order.</b>

07:34.640 --> 07:38.240
<b>The crystallization of the power to 
return everything to nothingness,</b>

07:38.240 --> 07:39.900
<b>One For All...</b>

07:41.020 --> 07:43.480
<b>If I can get a hold of that...</b>

07:44.940 --> 07:49.770
<b>All the colluding in the world, even with 
New Order, could be crushed like an ant.</b>

07:51.680 --> 07:53.600
<b>Knowingly or not,</b>

07:53.600 --> 08:00.240
<b>you coming here on your own was the 
development I wanted the least.</b>

08:01.110 --> 08:06.300
<b>I had to gamble with this incomplete body...</b>

08:07.460 --> 08:08.870
<b>But the bet...</b>

08:10.030 --> 08:14.920
<b>I won the bet, America!</b>

08:15.730 --> 08:18.980
<b>"Cathleen Bate will not decay!"</b>

08:22.690 --> 08:24.340
<b>She covered me...!</b>

08:24.900 --> 08:27.280
<b>Y-You idiot!</b>

08:27.630 --> 08:30.440
<b>I completely agree with you!</b>

08:32.150 --> 08:33.820
<b>It's no good, huh?</b>

08:33.820 --> 08:36.890
<b>It's hitting the limits of how much 
I could increase my stamina.</b>

08:37.250 --> 08:40.210
<b>Decay... won't stop...</b>

08:41.640 --> 08:42.970
<b>It's mine!</b>

08:44.100 --> 08:48.290
<b>The body is decaying at the same 
time I'm absorbing the Quirk.</b>

08:49.470 --> 08:54.670
<b>As long as New Order is a Quirk that 
activates when a declaration is made,</b>

08:55.060 --> 08:59.350
<b>you won't be able protect your Quirk 
and your body at the same time.</b>

09:00.740 --> 09:05.720
<b>You prioritized your body and lost both.</b>

09:06.870 --> 09:10.150
<b>This is where it starts, Yoichi.</b>

09:11.480 --> 09:14.670
<b>In those comics we read together back then,</b>

09:15.810 --> 09:19.800
<b>it wasn't that I didn't know 
that the story continued.</b>

09:21.460 --> 09:23.590
<b>New Order!</b>

09:23.590 --> 09:28.360
<b>I knew what was going to happen and 
stopped reading because of it.</b>

09:28.360 --> 09:29.570
<b>"The air"--</b>

09:54.830 --> 09:58.410
<b>What? Tomura's... cracking?!</b>

09:59.530 --> 10:01.140
<b>What's going on?</b>

10:01.140 --> 10:03.600
<b>My Quirk's rupturing...</b>

10:04.340 --> 10:05.890
<b>No way...</b>

10:05.890 --> 10:07.050
<b>Star!</b>

10:07.490 --> 10:11.570
<b>Yes, an aircraft explosion 
wouldn't have been enough,</b>

10:11.570 --> 10:15.430
<b>so before Tomura Shigaraki 
got me, I made a rule.</b>

10:16.830 --> 10:18.770
<b>"New Order...</b>

10:20.670 --> 10:24.340
<b>...will oppose other Quirks"!</b>

10:34.370 --> 10:37.950
<b>Cathleen Bate!</b>

10:38.470 --> 10:40.400
<b>The worst result...</b>

10:40.400 --> 10:43.780
<b>would've been to have my Quirk stolen 
and for everyone to be wiped out.</b>

10:44.430 --> 10:47.760
<b>It would've been nice to 
also protect my own body,</b>

10:47.760 --> 10:50.300
<b>but that would've just 
been the cherry on top.</b>

10:51.540 --> 10:53.790
<b>If it was a one-to-one trade...</b>

10:54.370 --> 10:57.840
<b>between a threat to the world and me...</b>

10:58.680 --> 11:00.640
<b>it was worth it.</b>

11:03.020 --> 11:04.330
<b>Bros...</b>

11:04.910 --> 11:06.730
<b>Thanks for everything...</b>

11:08.020 --> 11:12.100
<b>Commander Agpar, sorry for always...</b>

11:13.190 --> 11:14.800
<b>being unreasonable...</b>

11:16.030 --> 11:17.190
<b>Star!</b>

11:18.690 --> 11:20.020
<b>Star...</b>

11:22.770 --> 11:25.360
<b>My Quirks are fighting each other!</b>

11:25.360 --> 11:27.740
<b>It's like they're cannibalizing 
each other...</b>

11:27.740 --> 11:28.780
<b>This is bad!</b>

11:29.350 --> 11:31.590
<b>Quirks can only be stolen or given...</b>

11:32.230 --> 11:33.860
<b>I can't just discard it!</b>

11:35.150 --> 11:37.390
<b>I have to give New Order to someone...</b>

11:38.180 --> 11:40.590
<b>The pilots! One of them--</b>

11:42.140 --> 11:43.140
<b>Fire!</b>

11:45.560 --> 11:46.960
<b>Don't give him time to recover!</b>

11:46.960 --> 11:50.730
<b>Star is still fighting inside of him!</b>

11:54.340 --> 11:57.360
<b>My Reflect Quirk... has been destroyed.</b>

11:57.900 --> 12:00.390
<b>It's working! He's getting weaker!</b>

12:00.390 --> 12:02.300
<b>Keep the lasers going!</b>

12:02.300 --> 12:04.910
<b>Don't let Star's sacrifice go to waste!</b>

12:06.160 --> 12:10.200
<b>My Quirks are getting 
destroyed one by one...</b>

12:11.110 --> 12:12.640
<b>by New Order!</b>

12:20.180 --> 12:21.340
<b>Oh...</b>

12:22.320 --> 12:23.840
<b>Back then...</b>

12:25.740 --> 12:29.210
<b>Because you saved me...</b>

12:31.840 --> 12:36.260
<b>I was able to lose myself... 
in a wonderful dream...</b>

12:38.620 --> 12:42.530
<b>That's why, All Might...</b>

12:44.540 --> 12:49.730
<b>This is how I'm... returning the favor...</b>

12:58.100 --> 12:59.550
<b>This is bad.</b>

12:59.550 --> 13:02.710
<b>Hurry... Damn it!</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:08.670
<b>The specter of All Might...!</b>

13:09.550 --> 13:10.680
<b>Don't let him escape!</b>

13:10.680 --> 13:11.750
<b>Shoot him down!</b>

13:12.600 --> 13:17.490
<b>I stole this wing Quirk from my 
dear Nomu before it exploded.</b>

13:18.100 --> 13:21.640
<b>If I add power to these 
wings, I can shake them!</b>

13:22.730 --> 13:24.190
<b>Someone...</b>

13:24.190 --> 13:26.760
<b>I have to give New Order to someone...</b>

13:28.550 --> 13:31.160
<b>Or else I'll disappear and cease to exist!</b>

13:32.480 --> 13:35.710
<b>I gave myself eight antenna bangs!</b>

13:36.580 --> 13:39.440
<b>You... again...</b>

13:40.700 --> 13:44.720
<b>No matter where I go, it's you...</b>

13:45.070 --> 13:47.090
<b>All Might!</b>

13:48.940 --> 13:50.550
<b>Damn it, damn it!</b>

13:51.370 --> 13:52.470
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:58.200 --> 13:59.600
<b>Star...</b>

14:00.940 --> 14:04.260
<b>You guys are with me starting today!</b>

14:04.260 --> 14:07.120
<b>Let's fight together until 
death do us part, brothers!</b>

14:08.540 --> 14:13.210
<b>This is how I'm... returning the favor...</b>

14:15.830 --> 14:17.100
<b>Star...</b>

14:17.820 --> 14:20.090
<b>Star and Stripe...</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:23.160
<b>You surpassed him...</b>

14:24.350 --> 14:26.090
<b>You were always...</b>

14:27.630 --> 14:31.760
<b>the greatest hero...</b>

14:39.550 --> 14:41.840
<b>There's nothing on TV!</b>

14:41.840 --> 14:43.760
<b>None of the channels are working.</b>

14:43.760 --> 14:45.440
<b>What'd you expect?</b>

14:45.440 --> 14:47.360
<b>The people at the TV stations 
have all been evacuated, too.</b>

14:47.670 --> 14:50.430
<b>The water and electricity 
in this place still works.</b>

14:50.430 --> 14:54.210
<b>Distribution might be dead, but they've 
left the necessities at least.</b>

14:56.750 --> 15:03.340
<b>Convicted Robber and Murderer
Kashiko Kashi</b>

14:57.910 --> 15:00.390
<b>After finally getting out of the slammer,</b>

15:00.390 --> 15:03.350
<b>those idiots are going crazy in the city.</b>

15:03.730 --> 15:06.340
<b>The wise ones, like me, start a 
second life in the countryside.</b>

15:10.750 --> 15:12.310
<b>Wh-What's that?!</b>

15:16.760 --> 15:19.650
<b>A hero...? No...</b>

15:19.650 --> 15:20.400
<b>A ghost?!</b>

15:20.790 --> 15:22.610
<b>There's still...</b>

15:22.610 --> 15:25.410
<b>a chance!</b>

15:26.190 --> 15:29.900
<b>Ms. Star must have imposed 
a rule on her Quirk</b>

15:28.400 --> 15:31.080
<b>Don't come closer! Don't come any closer!</b>

15:29.900 --> 15:33.550
<b>to prevent other Quirks from 
existing together with it.</b>

15:34.570 --> 15:35.960
<b>In that case--</b>

15:36.730 --> 15:40.290
<b>I'll steal someone else's 
Quirk, make him Quirkless,</b>

15:40.650 --> 15:43.550
<b>and give him New Order so I can store it!</b>

15:43.820 --> 15:45.050
<b>Idiot.</b>

15:47.020 --> 15:51.640
<b>"New Order will oppose other Quirks."</b>

15:52.350 --> 15:56.630
<b>Thanks to all those Quirks you have,</b>

15:56.630 --> 16:00.140
<b>"I" will also be caught in 
the backlash and disappear.</b>

16:01.170 --> 16:04.530
<b>It's too bad I wasn't able 
to kill you completely,</b>

16:04.530 --> 16:07.780
<b>but remember this well, John Doe.</b>

16:08.670 --> 16:11.560
<b>As long people help each other,</b>

16:11.560 --> 16:18.050
<b>someone who inherits the spirit of a 
hero will destroy you, without fail.</b>

16:20.070 --> 16:21.670
<b>That's enough.</b>

16:22.260 --> 16:25.420
<b>For humans, the one who survives, wins.</b>

16:26.560 --> 16:29.640
<b>Get away from here, you corpse.</b>

16:34.790 --> 16:37.710
<b>Someone who's... a hero...</b>

16:40.880 --> 16:42.100
<b>Midoriya...</b>

16:47.780 --> 16:52.390
<b>After Shigaraki escaped, a search 
was launched immediately,</b>

16:52.920 --> 16:56.170
<b>but all they found were traces of fighting.</b>

16:56.610 --> 16:59.310
<b>It wasn't enough to track down Shigaraki.</b>

17:00.710 --> 17:03.770
<b>The news of the death of 
America's number one hero</b>

17:03.770 --> 17:06.410
<b>spread around the world the same day.</b>

17:08.000 --> 17:11.920
<b>The fact that the hero celebrated as the 
strongest in the world couldn't win</b>

17:11.920 --> 17:14.000
<b>made the other countries shrink away.</b>

17:15.360 --> 17:16.790
<b>You're calling off the dispatch?!</b>

17:17.080 --> 17:18.710
<b>Are you abandoning Japan?</b>

17:18.710 --> 17:22.170
<b>No! We're not abandoning 
our own country, Salaam!</b>

17:22.170 --> 17:23.810
<b>The loss of heroes</b>

17:24.190 --> 17:26.140
<b>leads to the destruction of their country.</b>

17:26.870 --> 17:28.130
<b>In that sense,</b>

17:28.130 --> 17:30.520
<b>rather than saving people 
in a faraway land,</b>

17:30.520 --> 17:33.320
<b>they were needed to protect 
their own countries.</b>

17:33.320 --> 17:38.320
<b>Police Station</b>

17:33.990 --> 17:38.320
<b>The world made the prompt decision 
to defer dispatching their heroes.</b>

17:41.410 --> 17:42.510
<b>Cassie...</b>

17:43.490 --> 17:44.760
<b>I wish I could've seen you...</b>

17:45.420 --> 17:48.520
<b>But Star's death was not in vain.</b>

17:49.180 --> 17:55.670
<b>The X-66s we arrived in have data from 
the fight with Tomura Shigaraki.</b>

17:56.170 --> 17:59.430
<b>They contain data of every 
biological response</b>

17:59.430 --> 18:01.600
<b>and Quirk analysis from the fight.</b>

18:01.600 --> 18:05.950
<b>I'm sure you'll be able to glean 
some sort of clue from this data.</b>

18:06.580 --> 18:11.030
<b>There's no way you weren't researching 
that monster... right?</b>

18:12.260 --> 18:14.970
<b>And then, the next day--</b>

18:15.330 --> 18:16.770
<b>An extension?</b>

18:17.240 --> 18:21.360
<b>Based on the data we received 
from the American aircraft,</b>

18:21.870 --> 18:26.340
<b>we were able to confirm that Shigaraki's 
body should have been completed tomorrow.</b>

18:26.750 --> 18:30.500
<b>But now, Shigaraki won't be able 
to move for at least a week.</b>

18:30.500 --> 18:34.620
<b>It's Star and Stripe's final 
gift to us--an extension.</b>

18:35.400 --> 18:37.470
<b>Star left this to us...</b>

18:38.520 --> 18:40.560
<b>The New Order he stole</b>

18:40.560 --> 18:43.320
<b>ate into Shigaraki like poison.</b>

18:44.190 --> 18:46.820
<b>We don't know how many Quirks he had,</b>

18:46.820 --> 18:50.110
<b>but we believe a good number 
of them were destroyed by it.</b>

18:51.050 --> 18:52.540
<b>So then right now...</b>

18:52.540 --> 18:54.620
<b>...is our best chance!</b>

18:54.620 --> 18:55.830
<b>That's right.</b>

18:55.830 --> 18:58.260
<b>We need to use this time efficiently</b>

18:58.260 --> 19:00.870
<b>and defeat Shigaraki and All For One.</b>

19:01.520 --> 19:04.530
<b>As we continue to evacuate civilians,</b>

19:04.530 --> 19:08.360
<b>all the remaining heroes are searching 
for Shigaraki and the others.</b>

19:09.140 --> 19:12.830
<b>But how will the seriously 
injured All For One act?</b>

19:13.190 --> 19:15.190
<b>It's harder than ever to tell.</b>

19:16.020 --> 19:20.440
<b>Whether we find them or not, it 
will likely be an all-out war.</b>

19:21.970 --> 19:23.880
<b>I said he wouldn't be able to move,</b>

19:23.880 --> 19:27.400
<b>but Tomura Shigaraki's 
still the vilest villain.</b>

19:27.780 --> 19:30.590
<b>There's also All For One's original body...</b>

19:31.060 --> 19:35.190
<b>The crazy Dabi, with flames 
that rival Endeavor's...</b>

19:35.710 --> 19:38.940
<b>Himiko Toga, the girl who 
continues to toy with us...</b>

19:39.250 --> 19:41.940
<b>The remaining six Near High Ends...</b>

19:42.580 --> 19:44.800
<b>The survivors of the Liberation Front...</b>

19:44.800 --> 19:50.330
<b>And those jailbreakers we haven't caught yet 
who are running riot on All For One's orders...</b>

19:50.830 --> 19:52.650
<b>And that's not all...</b>

19:52.650 --> 19:55.670
<b>Yeah, there will be more.</b>

19:56.310 --> 19:57.670
<b>Compared to that,</b>

19:57.670 --> 20:01.550
<b>on our side, our numbers on the 
front lines have been cut in half.</b>

20:02.190 --> 20:04.880
<b>I know Star just died in the line of duty,</b>

20:05.910 --> 20:10.480
<b>but in order for you to protect yourselves 
and those you want to protect,</b>

20:10.480 --> 20:14.590
<b>you need to use this extension 
to get as strong as you can.</b>

20:14.890 --> 20:16.900
<b>What do you think we've been doing?!</b>

20:18.580 --> 20:21.690
<b>You left with Deku, so you 
don't know, All Might.</b>

20:21.690 --> 20:24.110
<b>Even when you're here, you 
leave again right away.</b>

20:24.500 --> 20:26.630
<b>Ever since Gunga and Jaku,</b>

20:26.940 --> 20:30.180
<b>we've continued intensive training 
we did with the Pussycats.</b>

20:30.180 --> 20:31.980
<b>As much as we can in the dorms, anyway.</b>

20:32.350 --> 20:35.150
<b>We intend to go with Midoriya</b>

20:35.150 --> 20:38.500
<b>and fight until Shigaraki and 
the others are defeated.</b>

20:38.500 --> 20:39.800
<b>That's right!</b>

20:40.070 --> 20:43.240
<b>After this, Kacchan and the others 
said they'd spar with me.</b>

20:43.240 --> 20:44.710
<b>So I can complete One For All--</b>

20:44.710 --> 20:46.920
<b>What?! I didn't say that!</b>

20:46.920 --> 20:48.810
<b>Did those jailbreakers break off your ears?!</b>

20:48.810 --> 20:50.050
<b>Stop that!</b>

20:50.570 --> 20:55.180
<b>I want to see if my new move, 
Cluster, works on it.</b>

20:55.570 --> 20:57.300
<b>If it can take One For All,</b>

20:57.300 --> 21:00.810
<b>it'll get me closer to going against 
Shigaraki and All For One.</b>

21:01.210 --> 21:02.520
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:02.870 --> 21:04.950
<b>Come and punch me, too!</b>

21:04.950 --> 21:07.530
<b>He's trying to hang onto his 
job as the punching bag...</b>

21:07.850 --> 21:10.750
<b>I have to get harder!</b>

21:10.750 --> 21:13.200
<b>We have to carry on Star's legacy.</b>

21:13.200 --> 21:14.860
<b>She's MY Star...</b>

21:14.860 --> 21:16.410
<b>She's everyone's Star.</b>

21:17.230 --> 21:21.540
<b>Now, shall we begin, you zygotes?</b>

21:23.720 --> 21:25.880
<b>Those zygotes from back then...</b>

21:26.710 --> 21:28.580
<b>hatched a long time ago.</b>

21:29.140 --> 21:31.290
<b>Not afraid of the storm,</b>

21:31.290 --> 21:34.120
<b>they're spreading their wings reassuringly.</b>

21:36.390 --> 21:37.820
<b>All For One.</b>

21:38.400 --> 21:41.270
<b>You really did do something stupid.</b>

21:42.570 --> 21:44.050
<b>I'll say it again...</b>

21:45.030 --> 21:46.530
<b>This class...</b>

21:47.160 --> 21:48.450
<b>is strong.</b>

23:19.920 --> 23:21.920
<b>Preview</b>

23:20.600 --> 23:21.910
<b>Here's the preview!</b>

23:22.320 --> 23:24.340
<b>In order to prepare for the coming battle,</b>

23:24.340 --> 23:27.170
<b>we continue to train to improve our Quirks.</b>

23:27.460 --> 23:32.310
<b>But the clutches of evil have been making 
their way into U.A. for a while now,</b>

23:32.310 --> 23:34.380
<b>eating away at it from within.</b>

23:35.000 --> 23:38.530
<b>Once you're caught, you 
can't run away anymore...</b>

23:38.530 --> 23:40.140
<b>from that great evil.</b>

23:40.730 --> 23:42.440
<b>Next time, "Villain."</b>

23:42.820 --> 23:46.690
<b>The light called justice 
sinks into the darkness.</b>

23:45.900 --> 23:49.890
<b>Next time: Villain</b>

23:46.690 --> 23:48.160
<b>Go beyond!</b>

23:48.160 --> 23:49.570
<b>Plus Ultra!</b>
